{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07455","headline":"自江西归至旧任官舍赠袁赞府 · 刘长卿","name":"自江西归至旧任官舍赠袁赞府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"却见同官喜复悲，此生何幸有归期。\n空庭客至逢摇落，旧邑人稀经乱离。\n湘路来过回鴈处，江城卧听捣衣时。\n南方风土劳君问，贾谊长沙岂不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07455.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07455","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}